-- src:1402 | 4. The request for access shall state the legal basis, the purpose and reasons of the request and set the period within which the access is to be provided, and the fines provided for in Article 101 for failure to provide access.
@ref Art 92(4) (src:1402)
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE
      `the request for access states the legal basis` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the request for access states the purpose and reasons of the request` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the request for access sets the period within which the access is to be provided` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the request for access states the fines provided for in Article 101 for failure to provide access` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Art 92(4) the request for access has the required content` MEANS
    IF NOT (`Arts 80 to 98 and 101 and 112 the group General applies` `the date asked`)
    THEN NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): Article 113 gives this provision its date of application; before that nothing is required
    ELSE IF       `the request for access states the legal basis`
              AND `the request for access states the purpose and reasons of the request`
              AND `the request for access sets the period within which the access is to be provided`
              AND `the request for access states the fines provided for in Article 101 for failure to provide access`
         THEN JUST TRUE
         ELSE JUST FALSE  -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "The request for access shall state the legal basis, the purpose and reasons of the request and set the period within which the access is to be provided, and the fines provided for in Article 101 for failure to provide access" (a requirement of form: a missing item means the request lacks the required content)

-- src:1403 | 5. The providers of the general-purpose AI model concerned or its representative shall supply the information requested. In the case of legal persons, companies or firms, or where the provider has no legal personality, the persons authorised to represent them by law or by their statutes, shall provide the access requested on behalf of the provider of the general-purpose AI model concerned.
@ref Art 92(5) (src:1403)
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE
      `the Commission has requested the information or access under Article 92` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Art 92(5) the provider of the general-purpose AI model concerned must supply the information requested` MEANS
    IF NOT (`Arts 80 to 98 and 101 and 112 the group General applies` `the date asked`)
    THEN NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): Article 113 gives this provision its date of application; before that nothing is owed
    ELSE IF `the Commission has requested the information or access under Article 92`
         THEN JUST TRUE
         ELSE NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the duty is to supply "the information requested", which exists only once a request is made

@ref Art 92(5)
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE
      `the Commission has requested the information or access under Article 92` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the day on which the period set in the request for access began` IS A DATE
      `the day on which the period set in the request for access ends` IS A DATE
GIVETH A DEONTIC `Art 92 party` `Art 92 act`
`Art 92(5) the duty of the provider of the general-purpose AI model concerned to supply the access requested` MEANS
    IF       `Arts 80 to 98 and 101 and 112 the group General applies` `the date asked`
         AND `the Commission has requested the information or access under Article 92`
    THEN PARTY `Art 92 the provider of the general-purpose AI model concerned`
         MUST `Art 92(5) supply the access requested`
         WITHIN (Day `the day on which the period set in the request for access ends`) MINUS (Day `the day on which the period set in the request for access began`)
         HENCE FULFILLED
         LEST BREACH BY `Art 92 the provider of the general-purpose AI model concerned` BECAUSE "the access requested was not provided within the period the request set under Article 92(4)"
    ELSE FULFILLED  -- nothing is owed on these facts

@ref Art 92(5)
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE
      `the Commission has requested the information or access under Article 92` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the provider is a legal person, a company or a firm, or has no legal personality` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Art 92(5) the persons authorised to represent the provider must provide the access requested on its behalf` MEANS
    IF NOT (`Arts 80 to 98 and 101 and 112 the group General applies` `the date asked`)
    THEN NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): Article 113 gives this provision its date of application; before that nothing is owed
    ELSE IF       `the Commission has requested the information or access under Article 92`
              AND `the provider is a legal person, a company or a firm, or has no legal personality`
         THEN JUST TRUE
         ELSE NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the sentence is about "legal persons, companies or firms, or where the provider has no legal personality"; for a natural person with legal personality it is silent

