§ `Article 93: power to request measures`

-- "Where necessary and appropriate, the Commission may request providers to: (a) ...; (b) ...; (c) ..."
DECLARE `Art 93(1) measure` IS ONE OF
    `Art 93(1)(a) take appropriate measures to comply with the obligations set out in Articles 53 and 54`
    `Art 93(1)(b) implement mitigation measures`
    `Art 93(1)(c) restrict the making available on the market, withdraw or recall the model`
    `Art 93(1) another measure`

-- src:1408 | 1. Where necessary and appropriate, the Commission may request providers to:
-- src:1409 | (a) take appropriate measures to comply with the obligations set out in Articles 53 and 54;
-- src:1410 | (b) implement mitigation measures, where the evaluation carried out in accordance with Article 92 has given rise to serious and substantiated concern of a systemic risk at Union level;
-- src:1411 | (c) restrict the making available on the market, withdraw or recall the model.
@ref Art 93(1) (src:1408-1411)
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE
      `the measure` IS AN `Art 93(1) measure`
      `the request is necessary and appropriate` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the evaluation carried out in accordance with Article 92 has given rise to serious and substantiated concern of a systemic risk at Union level` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Art 93(1) the Commission may request the provider to take the measure` MEANS
    IF NOT (`Arts 80 to 98 and 101 and 112 the group General applies` `the date asked`)
    THEN NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): Article 113 gives this provision its date of application; before that the Regulation gives no such power
    ELSE CONSIDER `the measure`
         WHEN `Art 93(1) another measure` THEN NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (list not closed): the grant names (a), (b) and (c) and does not say "only"
         WHEN `Art 93(1)(a) take appropriate measures to comply with the obligations set out in Articles 53 and 54`
              THEN IF `the request is necessary and appropriate`
                   THEN JUST TRUE
                   ELSE JUST FALSE  -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "Where necessary and appropriate, the Commission may request providers to" (a "where" gate on a "may": split site (ii), fork F-93-1a)
         WHEN `Art 93(1)(b) implement mitigation measures`
              THEN IF NOT `the request is necessary and appropriate`
                   THEN JUST FALSE  -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "Where necessary and appropriate, the Commission may request providers to" (a "where" gate on a "may": split site (ii), fork F-93-1a)
                   ELSE IF `the evaluation carried out in accordance with Article 92 has given rise to serious and substantiated concern of a systemic risk at Union level`
                        THEN JUST TRUE
                        ELSE JUST FALSE  -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "(b) implement mitigation measures, where the evaluation carried out in accordance with Article 92 has given rise to serious and substantiated concern of a systemic risk at Union level" (a "where" gate on a "may": split site (ii), fork F-93-1b)
         WHEN `Art 93(1)(c) restrict the making available on the market, withdraw or recall the model`
              THEN IF `the request is necessary and appropriate`
                   THEN JUST TRUE
                   ELSE JUST FALSE  -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "Where necessary and appropriate, the Commission may request providers to" (a "where" gate on a "may": split site (ii), fork F-93-1a)

