§ `Article 94: procedural rights of economic operators of the general-purpose AI model`

-- src:1416 | Article 18 of Regulation (EU) 2019/1020 shall apply mutatis mutandis to the providers of the general-purpose AI model, without prejudice to more specific procedural rights provided for in this Regulation.
@ref Art 94 (src:1416)
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE
      `the person is a provider of a general-purpose AI model` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Art 94 Article 18 of Regulation (EU) 2019/1020 applies mutatis mutandis to the provider` MEANS
    IF NOT (`Arts 80 to 98 and 101 and 112 the group General applies` `the date asked`)
    THEN NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): Article 113 gives this provision its date of application; before that the Regulation does not apply that Article
    ELSE IF `the person is a provider of a general-purpose AI model`
         THEN JUST TRUE  -- "without prejudice to more specific procedural rights provided for in this Regulation": a more specific right prevails, which is outside this function
         ELSE NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the Article applies to "the providers of the general-purpose AI model"; for another person it is silent
